# TMDB credential — https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Either form works; the scripts pick the auth scheme from the value's shape:
#   the v4 "API Read Access Token" (a long eyJ... JWT), or
#   the v3 "API Key" (32 hex characters).
# Only needed to run `npm run refresh`. The app never calls TMDB from the browser.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste the value below. The scripts read it
# automatically, so the credential never goes on a command line — which also
# sidesteps shell differences (`VAR=value cmd` is bash-only and fails on
# Windows cmd.exe). Quotes around the value are optional; they are stripped.
TMDB_TOKEN=

# Optional: comma-separated ISO-3166-1 regions to build watch-provider data for.
REGIONS=IN,US
